  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:400px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-maroon pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Theft Combat</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/4e/Kung_Fu_Panda_4_Chameleon_Tai_Lung.gif/revision/latest?cb=20241006015125\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Kung Fu Panda 4 Chameleon Tai Lung\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/4e/Kung_Fu_Panda_4_Chameleon_Tai_Lung.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20241006015125\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/4e/Kung_Fu_Panda_4_Chameleon_Tai_Lung.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20241006015125 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/4e/Kung_Fu_Panda_4_Chameleon_Tai_Lung.gif/revision/latest?cb=20241006015125 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Kung Fu Panda 4 Chameleon Tai Lung\" width=\"270\" height=\"116\" data-image-key=\"Kung_Fu_Panda_4_Chameleon_Tai_Lung.gif\" data-image-name=\"Kung Fu Panda 4 Chameleon Tai Lung.gif\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">The Chameleon (Kung Fu Panda 4) uses Tai Lung's stolen Kung Fu skills to become a deadly warrior.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Infuse thieving skills with physical combat.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The ability to <b>infuse thieving skills with physical combat</b>.\nTechnique of <a href=\"/wiki/Archetype:Thief\" title=\"Archetype:Thief\">Thief</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Combat_Merging\" title=\"Combat Merging\">Combat Merging</a>. Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Combat\" title=\"Absorption Combat\">Absorption Combat</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Anime/Manga/Manhwa\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Anime/Manga/Manhwa</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Music\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Music</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTheft_Combat%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Stealing Combat</li>\n<li>Thief/Thievery Combat</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTheft_Combat%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can infuse thieving skills with physical combat. This can take various forms, such as stealing material and/or immaterial aspects from targets one attacks or combining stolen goods with martial skills.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTheft_Combat%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Access_%26_Occlusion\" title=\"Access &amp; Occlusion\">Access &amp; Occlusion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Combat_Mastery/Enhanced\" title=\"Combat Mastery/Enhanced\">Enhanced Combat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Theft_Defense\" title=\"Theft Defense\">Theft Defense</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Thief_Mode\" title=\"Thief Mode\">Thief Mode</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Thievery/Enhanced\" title=\"Thievery/Enhanced\">Enhanced Thievery</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTheft_Combat%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Combat_Merging\" title=\"Combat Merging\">Combat Merging</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Combat\" title=\"Absorption Combat\">Absorption Combat</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Archetype:Thief\" title=\"Archetype:Thief\">Thief</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Thievery_Mastery\" title=\"Thievery Mastery\">Thievery Mastery</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTheft_Combat%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Combat_Opposition\" title=\"Combat Opposition\">Combat Opposition</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Combat_Reduction\" title=\"Combat Reduction\">Combat Reduction</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Theft_Nullification\" title=\"Theft Nullification\">Theft Nullification</a></li>\n<li>May only be able to steal certain aspects and/or objects when fighting.</li>\n<li>May require certain tools to fight and steal simultaneously.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTheft_Combat%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://finalfantasy.fandom.com/wiki/Thief_(Final_Fantasy_X-2)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:finalfantasy:Thief (Final Fantasy X-2)\">Thief Dressphere</a> Users (<i>Final Fantasy X-2</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://herokiller.fandom.com/wiki/Ihwa\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:herokiller:Ihwa\">Ihwa/Hero Killer</a> (<i>Hero Killer</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://hunterxhunter.fandom.com/wiki/Chrollo_Lucilfer\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:hunterxhunter:Chrollo Lucilfer\">Chrollo Lucilfer</a> (<i>Hunter x Hunter</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://kungfupanda.fandom.com/wiki/The_Chameleon\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:kungfupanda:The Chameleon\">The Chameleon</a> (<i>Kung Fu Panda 4</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://majo-taisen.fandom.com/wiki/Bonnie_Parker\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:majo-taisen:Bonnie Parker\">Bonnie Parker</a> (<i>Majo Taisen: The War of Greedy Witches</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://myheroacademia.fandom.com/wiki/All_For_One_(Quirk)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:myheroacademia:All For One (Quirk)\">All For One</a> Users (<i>My Hero Academia</i>)\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://myheroacademia.fandom.com/wiki/Nine\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:myheroacademia:Nine\">Nine</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://myheroacademia.fandom.com/wiki/Toya_Setsuno\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:myheroacademia:Toya Setsuno\">Toya Setsuno</a> (<i>My Hero Academia</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://nanatsu-no-taizai.fandom.com/wiki/Ban\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:nanatsu-no-taizai:Ban\">Ban</a> (<i>Nanatsu no Taizai/The Seven Deadly Sins</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://onepiece.fandom.com/wiki/Charlotte_Linlin\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:onepiece:Charlotte Linlin\">Charlotte \"Big Mom\" Linlin</a> (<i>One Piece</i>); via <a href=\"https://onepiece.fandom.com/wiki/Soru_Soru_no_Mi\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:onepiece:Soru Soru no Mi\">Soru Soru no Mi/Soul-Soul Fruit</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTheft_Combat%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span id=\"Anime.2FManga.2FManhwa\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Anime/Manga/Manhwa\">Anime/Manga/Manhwa</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTheft_Combat%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D8&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\">\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"3d0011efe88df854588846ad34b7d1e